<title>DENMARK: Danisco six-month 1996/97 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Danisco six-month 1996/97 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Oct 31, 1996</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group ordinary pre-tax result    851  vs 785</p>
<p> Group operating result	     939  vs 839</p>
<p> Group net turnover	  8.319 billion vs 7.826 billion</p>
<p> Net financial items	    minus 88   vs minus 54</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish food, drinks and packaging group is Danisco A/S. It said in a statement that it expected its full year 1996/97 result to be 10-12 percent better than whole year 1995/96. The result was a little above average analyst expectations of an 844 million crown ordinary pre-tax profit for first-half 1996/97.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom, 45-33-969650</p>
</text>
